{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"596e12e88f20bda085f475cd8057e433ebcfbd7db4b18a72e7597b0902128ee5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["準繩的異象"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又舉目觀看，見一人手拿準繩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我說：「你往哪裏去？」他對我說：「要去量耶路撒冷，看有多寬多長。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["與我說話的天使去的時候，又有一位天使迎着他來，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["對他說：「你跑去告訴那少年人說，耶路撒冷必有人居住，好像無城牆的鄉村，因為人民和牲畜甚多。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和華說：我要作耶路撒冷四圍的火城，並要作其中的榮耀。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["呼喚被擄者歸回"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和華說：「我從前分散你們在天的四方",{"noteId":0},"，現在你們要從北方之地逃回。這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["與巴比倫人同住的錫安民哪，應當逃脫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["萬軍之耶和華說，在顯出榮耀之後，差遣我去懲罰那擄掠你們的列國，摸你們的就是摸他眼中的瞳人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["看哪，我",{"noteId":1},"要向他們掄手，他們就必作服事他們之人的擄物，你們便知道萬軍之耶和華差遣我了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["錫安城啊，應當歡樂歌唱，因為我來要住在你中間。這是耶和華說的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["那時，必有許多國歸附耶和華，作他",{"noteId":2},"的子民。他",{"noteId":3},"要住在你中間，你就知道萬軍之耶和華差遣我到你那裏去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和華必收回猶大作他聖地的分，也必再揀選耶路撒冷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["凡有血氣的都當在耶和華面前靜默無聲；因為他興起，從聖所出來了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"原文是猶如天的四風","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":6}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：他","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":9}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"原文是我","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":11}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"原文是我","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}